OL,3,GNEWSAHow thousands of items left at tip
OL,4,Aare sold on
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 30,000 household items
OL,7,Fdonated at the tip have been sold from
OL,8,Fa re-use shop in the first three months
OL,9,Fsince it opened.
OL,11,FRenew North Tyneside said it had
OL,12,Fmanaged to prevent more than 70 tonnes
OL,13,Fof household goods from going to
OL,14,Flandfill.
OL,16,FThe profits from the shop are donated
OL,17,Fto local charities and initiatives that
OL,18,Fsupport the environment in North
OL,19,FTyneside.
